    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU)  Data Innovation Office (DIO)  recently concluded the DataFest Africa 2025 - Nairobi Satellite Edition, a high-energy gathering that explored how African communities can reclaim their data futures and shape ethical, inclusive digital systems. Co-hosted with Pollicy (Uganda), the Nairobi programme combined lightning talks, a keynote panel, exhibitions and community dialogues to connect innovators, policymakers, researchers, creatives and grassroots changemakers under the theme \"Reclaiming Our Data Futures.\"",
